OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790119095
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ACall of Duty's Activision to make next
OL,4,AHalo game as Xbox cuts more jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FJez Corden of Windows Central said the
OL,7,Fchange was a "dramatic move", while
OL,8,Fgaming analyst Christopher Dring said
OL,9,Fit raised questions over whether it
OL,10,Fcould help revive what was once Xbox's
OL,11,F"crown jewel".
OL,13,FIt comes as questions also mount over
OL,14,Fthe future of other notable Xbox
OL,15,Fstudios, including Cambridge-based game
OL,16,Fdeveloper Ninja Theory.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
